Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…The Searched Item at Dusk.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:06.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.35,0:00:06.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s… with that outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.69,0:00:10.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re digging up potatoes at the preschool today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.57,0:00:12.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Where and how did you see it done like that?! {Keeper: orig line "What did you see and where did you see it?!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{magazine, cover and spine say the same}Tomorrow’s Agriculture
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:16.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,In a magazine at the convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:21.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone was dressed like this while working in the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:24.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How the hell are you supposed to\Ndig potatoes with a butterfly net?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{opening}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.89,0:02:09.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for everything this year as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.06,0:02:10.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Take as many as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:14.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:18.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it? You’re responsible for\Ncarrying any potatoes you dig up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:21.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Dig up only as many as you can carry, promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:24.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, look! They’re connected!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:26.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They’re so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.91,0:02:28.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They really are!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.35,0:02:30.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s like looking for treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:33.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:37.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.51,0:02:39.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:42.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,D-Dobato… {Keeper: Hmm… Thought style? He’s usually very aware of speaking in the presence of humans}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.97,0:02:45.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, your butt’s covered in dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:46.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.72,0:02:49.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who’s that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:56.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He looks a little older than the\Nchildren from Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.57,0:03:00.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he a member of this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:03.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, the grandchild of this\Nfamily is already in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.99,0:03:05.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:08.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Whose child is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.88,0:03:16.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.63,0:03:19.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.13,0:03:22.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you live in the neighborhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:29.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.91,0:03:51.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry, it took us a while to realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:55.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, there are those who cause mischief sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:03:58.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if he lives in the neighborhood…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.17,0:04:03.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, we should wrap this up and get going soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:05.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:06.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You sure dug up a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.22,0:04:09.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:11.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s a lot of potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:14.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I worked hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.78,0:04:15.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:18.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,As I said when we started…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.11,0:04:21.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…you’re responsible for carrying what you dig up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:26.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, let’s go back and grill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:31.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, will you be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:33.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Should we carry some for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:40.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be fine! I can carry them by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.13,0:04:43.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All of them would be too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:44.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.59,0:04:48.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, we promised that we\Nwould carry what we dug up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:50.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:54.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You really are a bully…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.23,0:05:03.40,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-This is impossible. Give it up, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.07,0:05:07.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:08.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:10.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:12.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign}Yomogi Preschool
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.79,0:05:19.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are they ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:21.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s smoky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.47,0:05:28.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.51,0:05:32.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:34.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:36.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They’re hot, so be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.35,0:05:40.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.56,0:05:41.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:45.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:49.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What should we do with all of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.49,0:05:52.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Should I grill some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:56.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s give them to the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{paper}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,People on 2nd Block
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{names, mostly illegible ^^;}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,People on 6th Block
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.71,0:06:03.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun, would you go with Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:05.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can go by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:07.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll be faster that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:10.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But I still think she should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:15.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I want her to get to know the neighbors more too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:17.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that okay, Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:18.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:24.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I {\i1}will{\i0} do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:27.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I won’t ask for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:28.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.53,0:06:35.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,My potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.95,0:06:40.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He really is a bully. He keeps\Ntelling me not to get in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.37,0:06:43.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He didn’t say “don’t come with me,” though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:47.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But he took my potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:49.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking of handing them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.13,0:06:54.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he took them because he\Nthought they were too heavy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:03.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.90,0:07:06.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re from Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:10.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We picked some delicious potatoes,\Nand we’d like to share some with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:13.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:19.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re from Yomogi Preschool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:22.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:24.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They’re potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:25.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:28.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re from Yomogi Preschool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:31.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:37.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll be finished giving out the potatoes soon! {Keeper: orig line "We’ll finish giving out the potatoes after a little more!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:38.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:48.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:52.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:53.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:55.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.78,0:07:58.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Young miss, it’s been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:07:59.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:02.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Milk, are you doing well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:07.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’ve gotten a little bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:08.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:10.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.05,0:08:17.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:22.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, he passed by and asked if he could use some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:24.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He said he dug up some potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:27.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re… the kid from earlier! {Keeper: Hmm… split?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.65,0:08:28.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:29.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:37.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.24,0:08:39.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let go, you thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:43.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s my line!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:44.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Potato thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:47.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:50.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:53.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m taking this thief to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:55.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:57.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll give them back! I’ll give them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:01.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.89,0:09:03.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re a runaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:05.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Runaway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,{9,0000,0000,0000,,12 eyecatch}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:27.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.71,0:09:32.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you won’t say anything? {Beat it outta the bastard! -Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:40.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:42.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“Potato Thief” will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:43.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m not a potato thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:48.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You have a name, don’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.11,0:09:55.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:00.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you run away from home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.83,0:10:04.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to go to my old home. {But now some assholes planted sweet potatoes where it used to be!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:06.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Your old home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:13.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I had to move out of the house I lived in because Mom’s company changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:16.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So what happened to your old home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:21.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven’t been there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.26,0:10:26.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you on the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:29.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I was trying to go there, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:31.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You forgot where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:33.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.77,0:10:37.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that face says you forgot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.61,0:10:38.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:42.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You wouldn’t forget where your home was, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:46.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean… I was still in kindergarten when I moved…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:50.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I got a little lost…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:52.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That means you forgot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:54.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven’t forgotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:10:58.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:11:02.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you know what house it is,\Nwe might be able to help you find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:05.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you draw what your house looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.51,0:11:08.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.81,0:11:12.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s see, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.73,0:11:17.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The roof was red, and there was a window here…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:20.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Here was the antenna, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:23.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Draw what’s around your house too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:26.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)}It’ll be easier to find that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.41,0:11:32.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,900)}There was a mailbox here, a dog nearby…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:39.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s a big dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:42.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He always barks whenever I pass by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshimura Keita
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.15,0:11:58.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And then, and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.15,0:12:00.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom always baked sweets…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:15.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She read picture books to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:19.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,and she’d take me to camps and\Namusement parks during her breaks…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:23.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:28.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to go back to my old home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:36.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:41.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’d like to help Keita-kun find his home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:54.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We won’t be able to find it with\Njust a dog and a mailbox as clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:58.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you remember anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.72,0:13:15.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Which way? Right, left?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:19.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um… th-this way…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.65,0:13:21.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it was this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:42.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I know this place! I’ve been here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:45.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? We might be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:48.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita-kun, isn’t that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:49.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.15,0:14:05.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Want a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:10.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be fine. I should economize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.03,0:14:11.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Economize?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:14.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You know some difficult words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:18.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom said it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:19.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:21.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign}Feel free to take one. {Keeper: orig line "Please take as you’d like"}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.34,0:14:27.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:31.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It is what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:32.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.06,0:14:35.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:38.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s leave these in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:45.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:48.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They’re good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:52.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto does have some good sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:56.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well… if he didn’t, that’d be troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:58.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Give me a pear too! {Keeper: Pear? Doesn’t look very… pear-ish}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:05.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,830)}Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.84,0:15:13.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Could that dog be…?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.02,0:15:18.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So that means…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:21.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This house next door…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.12,0:15:37.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn’t my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign}Yoshimura
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:46.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:10.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m opening it.{ori:Move}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:16.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,My room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:20.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:23.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll have to bust in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.62,0:16:24.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:26.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.96,0:16:30.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t break it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:41.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t want to go back to the house you live in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.89,0:16:46.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But my grandpa’s there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:48.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Your grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.77,0:16:49.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:54.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom and I are living with my grandpa now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:59.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita-kun, do you not like your grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.24,0:17:01.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s such a bully!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.41,0:17:04.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Bully…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:08.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:12.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s so noisy when he wakes me up in the morning. {Keeper: orig line "He’s so noisy to wake me up in the morning."}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:17.30,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Keita! Wake up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.09,0:17:20.10,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}Hurry up and clean up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:25.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to watch more TV at\Nnight and play video games…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:28.65,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:30.86,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa, what’re you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:33.36,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}Stop staying up late and get to bed already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:38.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He keeps telling me to eat all\Nthe things I hate during dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:40.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The things you hate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:43.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Like the small fish and vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:45.29,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:50.21,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,800)}Don’t play with your food! Eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:53.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that bullying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:56.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It is! Grandpa hates me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:18:01.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why he says all those mean things to me and thinks I should just leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.97,0:18:03.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why that house…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:05.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.43,0:18:08.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei tells the kids in the preschool
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:14.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,to eat their fish and vegetables because they have nutrients.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.15,0:18:17.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who’s Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:24.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei is the kind teacher at\NYomogi Preschool who loves children.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:26.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.84,0:18:40.93,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:48.64,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Once you’ve finished your bath, head to bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:19:00.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s hard to tell when someone’s bullying you or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:04.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But if you take a careful look, you might figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:07.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita, were you…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:10.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…going to grill potatoes here or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:15.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It was really nice when we\Ngrilled potatoes here last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.09,0:19:21.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You should take responsibility and return some.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:25.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve already apologized to the farmer lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:29.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s the one who dug up too many, and now we’ve got a lot leftover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:32.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita-kun, isn’t that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:36.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:47.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure you can go back by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:49.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:51.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.42,0:19:54.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:01.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:04.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:12.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:22.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.03,0:20:25.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:27.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:33.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.54,0:20:34.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.67,0:20:37.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:39.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What was that for, you old fart?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.67,0:20:42.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t make people worry, you complete idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:45.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let’s go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.97,0:20:48.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.35,0:20:55.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom’s waiting too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:20:56.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.19,0:21:03.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita-kun’s with his grandfather and they’re about to get on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.61,0:21:05.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no problem. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:11.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, were you calling Keita-kun’s home?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:14.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you call Keita-kun’s grandfather to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.58,0:21:15.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:18.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides that, I’m hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.17,0:21:23.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,When we get back, maybe I’ll eat some steamed potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:24.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:25.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.97,0:21:27.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.59,0:21:29.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:32.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:34.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.35,0:21:36.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you heading home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:39.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve got things to do, so I’ll leave first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:41.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Things to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:45.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We dug up potatoes at the preschool today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:47.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And we’ve been giving them to the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.49,0:21:48.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:50.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:55.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He really is a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.75,0:22:01.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Kiyokazu is a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:09.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That must be the kid’s.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.97,0:22:14.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita-kun seemed sad about his old house though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.18,0:22:18.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it must be because he understands how his grandfather really feels now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.35,0:22:22.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.57,0:22:25.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, since Fujimoto did so much work today…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.19,0:22:28.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Half score of 50 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:32.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But… Fujimoto-san was such a bully in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.37,0:22:35.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.62,0:22:37.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I’ll cancel that out and Fujimoto gets zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.46,0:22:40.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll give a 70 for your work!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.21,0:22:44.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Erase the other one before you write that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.59,0:22:46.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re so full of complaints!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.80,0:22:49.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's bring it back to 50 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.01,0:22:50.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,After you erase it…!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.47,0:22:51.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.43,0:22:52.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,25 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:54.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Still unsatisfied?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.72,0:22:56.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then 12.5 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.56,0:22:59.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1200)}My face is pitch black!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,"…The Concealed Prayer."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
